,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1141.834820051,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1141.834824493,"data":"CAVEAT, and it decides how much of this is quotable.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1141.83485054,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1141.834854982,"data":"The corrected slice carries roughly six `high` frames in 1,248. Split five ways,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1141.834860081,"data":"some validation folds contain one or none. Quadratic weighted kappa is unstable\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1141.834866945,"data":"when a class is absent from a fold: sklearn returns 0.0 for a degenerate fold\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1141.83487406,"data":"rather than a defined value, and a single frame flipping can move a fold's QWK by\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1141.834879802,"data":"a large amount. The corrected LoRA figure shows exactly this, ±0.236 around a mean\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1141.834886249,"data":"of 0.282 with one fold at −0.103.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1141.834892479,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1141.834898068,"data":"So treat the five-fold mean as indicative and report the per-fold spread beside\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1141.83490321,"data":"it, as the manuscript already does elsewhere. If the baseline and LoRA intervals\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1141.834908256,"data":"overlap, the honest sentence is that this slice cannot separate them, not that\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1141.834913217,"data":"one wins. A properly powered comparison needs either more `high` frames or a\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1141.834929798,"data":"two-class collapse, and that is a decision about the paper's task definition\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1141.834933869,"data":"rather than something this notebook can settle.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1141.834937837,"data":"\n"}
